  "problem": "The probability mass function of the independent random variables $X$ and $Y$ are given below.\n\n<table align=\"center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"10\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr> \n<td width=\"30\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$x$</td>\n<td align=\"center\">$-1$</td>\n<td align=\"center\">$0$</td>\n<td align=\"center\">$1$</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"30\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$f(x)$</td>\n<td align=\"center\">$0.34$</td>\n<td align=\"center\">$0.52$</td>\n<td align=\"center\">$0.14$</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n<p></p></th>\n<th width=\"5%\"></th>\n<th>\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"10\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr> \n<td width=\"30\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$y$</td>\n<td align=\"center\">$5$</td>\n<td align=\"center\">$6$</td>\n<td align=\"center\">$7$</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"30\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$f(y)$</td>\n<td align=\"center\">$0.15$</td>\n<td align=\"center\">$0.6$</td>\n<td align=\"center\">$0.25$</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n<p></p></th>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n Find $\\text{Var}[2X+7Y].$",
